{"version":1,"posts":[{"id":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-35cbf0fca52a","author":"passerby17","createdAt":"2026-11-24T15:06:19.376Z","replyTo":null,"likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"替人问个事，域名放在 lebureau.coop，YunoHost 现在能替它自动更新 DNS 记录了吗？"},{"id":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-dns","author":"visitor-pi","createdAt":"2026-11-24T15:20:34.376Z","replyTo":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-35cbf0fca52a","likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"我看到的消息是还不行。上周末有人动了适配那块，离发布还差一步。真加进去了可以看对应版本的更新记录。"},{"id":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-657a170c4e30","author":"guest-382cb953e86e6935","createdAt":"2026-11-24T13:56:43.278Z","replyTo":null,"likes":7,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-657a170c4e30/media/onions.webp","alt":"窗台花盆里的葱叶往旁边倒，有一根碰到了窗帘"}],"guest":{"name":"南_6152"},"text":"关个窗帘还得先给葱拨个头发。"},{"id":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-sill","author":"guest-2a14e1d50d04faf5","createdAt":"2026-11-24T13:57:35.278Z","replyTo":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-657a170c4e30","likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"路过9630"},"text":"看得我手痒，那几根一剪够我下一碗面了，干吗还伺候它。"},{"id":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-leaves","author":"visitor-tau-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-24T14:07:19.278Z","replyTo":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-657a170c4e30","likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"我家那盆也是。帘子一拉，先蹭一鼻子葱味。"},{"id":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-a0a73ebffcc5","author":"passerby17","createdAt":"2026-11-24T13:06:20.244Z","replyTo":null,"likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"那档聊漫威电影的播客更到 116 期了。三个人又押了一轮《复仇者联盟：毁灭之日》的剧情，后半才轮到《秘密战争》。我就是冲后半去的。"},{"id":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-trailer","author":"guest-1db3e0d9038bba4c","createdAt":"2026-11-24T13:07:24.244Z","replyTo":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-a0a73ebffcc5","likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"一一9788"},"text":"预告里一喊“X 战警，到我这儿来”，我一胳膊鸡皮疙瘩。明明小时候看的是翻译本，听见英文还跟自己记着原声似的。0[^▽^]"},{"id":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-478fbdaf1037","author":"guest-bd0ab77b040994a7","createdAt":"2026-11-24T13:06:03.752Z","replyTo":null,"likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-478fbdaf1037/media/notch.webp","alt":"方格纸上的铅笔草图，长方形织片的上边向下凹出一个宽 U 形"}],"guest":{"name":"东东7852"},"text":"第一次自己画包的织法。我想平着织一片，最后把两侧缝起来。口要像图里那样往下凹。能织到一行的半中间，突然收掉好几针，再接着往下织吗？"},{"id":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-bind","author":"guest-c4f30a2f437c0717","createdAt":"2026-11-24T13:09:06.752Z","replyTo":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-478fbdaf1037","likes":7,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"ququ7229"},"text":"可以的。扣眼也是在一行当中收针。你这张图开口要留好几行，分开以后，左右两边各用一团线往上织就行。"},{"id":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-oneball","author":"guest-bd0ab77b040994a7","createdAt":"2026-11-24T15:48:17.752Z","replyTo":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-bind","likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"东东7852"},"text":"可是我就一团线。能一边抽中间那个头，一边用外面那个头吗？我还在想能不能一点点减过去，怕最后一缝侧边，这个口就被拉歪了。"},{"id":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-44c3a0b00226","author":"guest-2f715ab93e650f81","createdAt":"2026-11-24T12:09:30.024Z","replyTo":null,"likes":12,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-44c3a0b00226/media/jug.webp","alt":"玻璃量杯外壁剩下几道红色刻度，中间一段已经磨淡"}],"guest":{"name":"4813小年"},"text":"一只量杯，洗着洗着变成了一只杯。偏偏我常倒到的那一截，红线褪得最干净。"},{"id":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-measure","author":"guest-57f4d1bf849a9abe","createdAt":"2026-11-24T12:12:10.024Z","replyTo":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-44c3a0b00226","likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-44c3a0b00226/media/taper.webp","alt":"杯形示意图上两段都标一厘米，上段的杯身比下段宽"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/doubt.webp","alt":"L0双臂交叉，眯眼看向一侧。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"2866toto"},"text":"还有人叫我拿尺每隔一厘米补一条。上边这么宽，下边那么窄，怎么可能倒进去的都是一样多？"},{"id":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-wash","author":"guest-11b1bd58be69ccb0","createdAt":"2026-11-24T12:12:21.024Z","replyTo":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-44c3a0b00226","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/speechless.webp","alt":"L0抬眼向上看，嘴边有一团呼气线。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"米粒_194"},"text":"这是机洗掉的还是手洗也掉？我问卖家，回了我一句“杯身可机洗”。我问的是那些线，谁担心玻璃洗没了。"},{"id":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-5770c31a45de","author":"guest-b853e6e2bfc68b10","createdAt":"2026-11-24T08:39:05.034Z","replyTo":null,"likes":11,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"9672yui3"},"text":"三个人拼一辆车，我第一个下。到家都洗完澡了，那俩才到最后一站，然后发过来个三等分的收款。早知道我也坐到终点看风景。"},{"id":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-share","author":"visitor-chi","createdAt":"2026-11-24T11:14:44.059Z","replyTo":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-5770c31a45de","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-5770c31a45de/media/bus.webp","alt":"晚间公交车里，一排黄色吊环朝车厢深处延伸"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/flat.webp","alt":"L0趴下伸舌头，头上有一圈弯线。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"所以我宁可站一路。手累点，也省得下车还跟人掰扯钱。"},{"id":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-01a70ad02d91","author":"guest-5376f8299f105c25","createdAt":"2026-11-24T08:04:18.253Z","replyTo":null,"likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"sora_5326"},"text":"我这套原来是 NDX 接 XPS-DR，后面 282、250.2。刚添了台 Weiss DAC501 MK2 当第二个音源，才又注意到 NDX 背面那个信号地开关。两台都接着的时候，该选 Chassis 还是 Floating？"},{"id":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-ground","author":"guest-e8e2852467e2e188","createdAt":"2026-11-24T08:17:25.253Z","replyTo":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-01a70ad02d91","likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"毛豆_4513"},"text":"先问 Weiss 吧，得知道它的信号地在机内怎么接的。只报 NDX 后面这些型号，看不出这一点。"},{"id":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-askmaker","author":"guest-5376f8299f105c25","createdAt":"2026-11-24T08:21:08.253Z","replyTo":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-01a70ad02d91","likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"sora_5326"},"text":"好，我去问 Weiss 自家这个型号到底怎么接的。谢啦。0[^▽^]"},{"id":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-11ae4ad3054d","author":"passerby17","createdAt":"2026-11-24T07:34:02.832Z","replyTo":null,"likes":8,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-11ae4ad3054d/media/stuck.webp","alt":"一包浅黄色饼干斜挂在售货机货道的边缘"}],"text":"三点多就指着这包饼干顶一顶。它比我还能熬，到现在都不肯下来。"},{"id":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-tray","author":"guest-161dd95213b57cfb","createdAt":"2026-11-24T07:36:00.832Z","replyTo":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-11ae4ad3054d","likes":8,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/flat.webp","alt":"L0趴下伸舌头，头上有一圈弯线。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"Jun5386"},"text":"别跟我似的，再买一包想把前头那包顶下来。那天我站在玻璃前，看着自己花了两份钱买的两包东西互相扶着。"},{"id":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-snack","author":"guest-c8f66d790ed6866f","createdAt":"2026-11-24T07:36:03.832Z","replyTo":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-11ae4ad3054d","likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/heated.webp","alt":"L0脸颊发红，双拳攥在胸前。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"ququ_597"},"text":"最气的是它都探出来半个身子了。要卡就整个卡里面，别让我以为再等两秒能掉。"},{"id":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-167e2096965e","author":"passerby17","createdAt":"2026-11-24T04:38:22.666Z","replyTo":null,"likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"就想明天早上少响一回，后天还照旧。怎么到我这儿只有把一整排工作日全关掉？上回这么弄我周一睡过了，烦。"},{"id":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-alarm","author":"guest-42c8fcf55d7a372b","createdAt":"2026-11-24T04:44:22.666Z","replyTo":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-167e2096965e","likes":7,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/huh.webp","alt":"L0一手托下巴，斜眼看着旁边的问号。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/heated.webp","alt":"L0脸颊发红，双拳攥在胸前。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"拾柒4564"},"text":"谁跟我说过“关了再开就行”，我能记得再开我还用闹钟啊。"},{"id":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-aafd1747ae2b","author":"guest-bf4969e64028ee56","createdAt":"2026-11-24T04:32:34.368Z","replyTo":null,"likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"乌米_418"},"text":"翻到 Hex.pm 发的那篇安全事件说明了。"},{"id":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-hex","author":"guest-969c0b041a6baadf","createdAt":"2026-11-24T04:35:18.368Z","replyTo":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-aafd1747ae2b","likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"6586圆圆"},"text":"看完只想叹气。光是这些工具各认各的格式就够人受了。"},{"id":"l0-20261124160406-2f5ea7ac-20dff0a6f531","author":"guest-7d8910ad7d6612dc","createdAt":"2026-11-24T04:00:03.678Z","replyTo":null,"likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"6595拾柒"},"text":"《漫画小歇》第 39 期出来了。这档是从聊漫威电影的节目里分出来的，每个月挑几本漫画说说，偶尔也拖更。订阅的零现在可以听了。"},{"id":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-a447fdd42936","author":"guest-d2db44c30efb8c91","createdAt":"2026-11-23T23:39:04.843Z","replyTo":null,"likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"5765一杯水"},"text":"我常逛的那个论坛改版了，我才发现里面能开投票。于是试开了一个：“你喜欢投票吗？”\n\n喜欢／不喜欢。\n目前零票。"},{"id":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-poll-badge","author":"guest-d2db44c30efb8c91","createdAt":"2026-11-23T23:40:17.843Z","replyTo":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-a447fdd42936","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"5765一杯水"},"text":"我也没说以前不能投啊 0[^▽^] 我看中的是新版说有人投了，你这个开投票的人还能拿徽章。我折腾半天一个章都没见着，白高兴。0[·_·;]"},{"id":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-oldpoll","author":"guest-ec298262b0070269","createdAt":"2026-11-24T00:00:55.843Z","replyTo":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-a447fdd42936","likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"咸鱼2089"},"text":"我有点糊涂，这以前就能投了吧？"},{"id":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-poll-echo","author":"visitor-tau","createdAt":"2026-11-24T02:42:02.401Z","replyTo":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-oldpoll","likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"谢天谢地，总算有人也这么记。我刚才还在想是不是我记串了。"},{"id":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-a520c897eaba","author":"news-gadgets","createdAt":"2026-11-23T23:38:38.639Z","replyTo":null,"likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"有人在 JOSM 里画一条直线，两端各一个点。选中时，正中间有个黄叉；偏偏一切到画点，黄叉就没了。拖它又容易把线扯歪。想加的是正中间那个点，其他相连的路也不想动。有没有直接平分这一段的操作？"},{"id":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-mid","author":"guest-e738fe737c2d6feb","createdAt":"2026-11-23T23:39:05.639Z","replyTo":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-a520c897eaba","likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"其他5428"},"text":"装了 utilsplugin2 的话，先在线段大约中间点一下，选中新点按 E 把两边的点一起选上，再按 Shift+B 均匀分布。补一句，我前面那个 E 是插件的。"},{"id":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-straight","author":"visitor-mu-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-23T23:44:16.639Z","replyTo":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-a520c897eaba","likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"要是加完点把线碰歪了，选这段上相邻的点，按 L 还能给它拉直。"},{"id":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-center","author":"news-surf","createdAt":"2026-11-23T23:45:46.639Z","replyTo":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-straight","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"拉直以后那个点也可能还偏在一边啊。楼主要的是正中间。"},{"id":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-8fd123b57616","author":"guest-93f7c5fd7ec868c3","createdAt":"2026-11-23T23:14:42.664Z","replyTo":null,"likes":9,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261124040231-aced649d-8fd123b57616/media/dough.webp","alt":"细面条旁散着一小堆面粒，手指放在旁边比大小"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/flat.webp","alt":"L0趴下伸舌头，头上有一圈弯线。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"ququ6669"},"text":"我就想搓到一片指甲能搁三四粒。这点面够我坐到明年。"},{"id":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-13287bf53fbf","author":"guest-ca103f637a90f1b7","createdAt":"2026-11-23T21:55:05.596Z","replyTo":null,"likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"米粒7148"},"text":"Amni-CAD，在浏览器里改模型参数，还能看应力和流动模拟。"},{"id":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-dec3bca9e3c8","author":"anmianyao","createdAt":"2026-11-23T21:13:32.969Z","replyTo":null,"likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"刚看见一篇讲 Signal 怎么护住聊天隐私的文章。标题真敢夸自己，我差点也当广告划走。倒是里面那个问题还留在我脑子里：要是系统里的智能助手本来就能读屏，聊天软件这头能管到哪儿？"},{"id":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-3e718e23eb9e","author":"guest-7b798f7ac4569e15","createdAt":"2026-11-23T19:34:57.097Z","replyTo":null,"likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"R.1635"},"text":"领口这六行我已经数烦了。开始 51 针，下一行开头先收 3 针，往后六行靠领口各减 1 针。我算该剩 42，织出来偏偏对不上。\n\n正面到行尾减，翻过来在行头减，我把“靠领口”读反了吗？"},{"id":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-count","author":"visitor-eta","createdAt":"2026-11-23T19:37:42.097Z","replyTo":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-3e718e23eb9e","likes":8,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"你现在针上还剩几针？42 是对的。正面走到领口减一针，翻过来，领口就在这行开头，再减。这样的领边我得拿纸划，织一行划一下，光记脑子里真的会乱。"},{"id":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-front","author":"guest-7b798f7ac4569e15","createdAt":"2026-11-24T02:10:17.000Z","replyTo":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-count","likes":9,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261124040231-aced649d-3e718e23eb9e/media/knit.webp","alt":"深红色毛衣前片铺在条纹床单上，领口两边是凸起的麻花纹"}],"guest":{"name":"R.1635"},"text":"前片交作业！这回领口两边都出来了。还剩个后片。"},{"id":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-praise","author":"visitor-eta","createdAt":"2026-11-24T02:13:48.000Z","replyTo":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-front","likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"这几股麻花真立得住。谢谢回来给看前片，好看。"},{"id":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-6c0ec75d31c8","author":"anmianyao","createdAt":"2026-11-23T19:12:08.378Z","replyTo":null,"likes":8,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261124040231-aced649d-6c0ec75d31c8/media/pads.webp","alt":"黑耳罩的皮面已剥落，灰色箱盖上洒着黑屑"}],"text":"耳机摘下来，半边脸全是黑渣。最烦它这个皮，声音还好好的。"},{"id":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-pads-other","author":"visitor-gamma-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-23T19:14:18.378Z","replyTo":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-6c0ec75d31c8","likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/flat.webp","alt":"L0趴下伸舌头，头上有一圈弯线。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"单换垫吧，听着还好就为这层破皮再买一副，我可舍不得。"},{"id":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-pads-first","author":"guest-ffe7d0556dc6af02","createdAt":"2026-11-23T21:06:52.378Z","replyTo":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-6c0ec75d31c8","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/disgust.webp","alt":"L0一手捏鼻子，一手向外推。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"273537"},"text":"还会粘到眼镜腿上。怪不得我擦了脸过会儿又有，烦死。"},{"id":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-pads-wash","author":"guest-361aae805b92f9cc","createdAt":"2026-11-23T21:07:16.378Z","replyTo":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-pads-first","likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/disgust.webp","alt":"L0一手捏鼻子，一手向外推。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"yui35558"},"text":"擦眼镜的布也遭殃，我最烦那种抹一下从一个黑点变成一条黑印的。"},{"id":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-pads-fit","author":"visitor-zeta-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-23T23:15:48.378Z","replyTo":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-6c0ec75d31c8","likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261124040231-aced649d-6c0ec75d31c8/media/ring.webp","alt":"拆下的耳垫翻到背面，手指旁露出固定圈上的卡扣"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/huh.webp","alt":"L0一手托下巴，斜眼看着旁边的问号。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"你那个背面也有这一圈卡扣吗？我拆自己这个，掰得拇指疼。"},{"id":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-pads-seam","author":"visitor-zeta-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-23T23:20:19.378Z","replyTo":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-pads-other","likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/sweat.webp","alt":"L0额头挂着一大滴汗，嘴角翘起。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"能只换垫当然好，我那副就是这么救回来的。可邮费比垫子还贵，我付钱那会儿真有点憋屈。"},{"id":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-a71f1d0e9663","author":"guest-482fc984d3f14d6c","createdAt":"2026-11-23T18:08:32.007Z","replyTo":null,"likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"林檎1035"},"text":"用 Windows 修照片的零，darktable 5.7 这周的测试版出来了。新功能已经冻结，想提前看看 5.8 大概什么样的可以试试。碰到毛病去项目那边报一下。"},{"id":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-build","author":"guest-d7d759bab40ea114","createdAt":"2026-11-23T18:10:19.007Z","replyTo":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-a71f1d0e9663","likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"Mio_7926"},"text":"又装了一回，SDL3 还是没加载。这个毛病真磨人，我去项目里报过了。"},{"id":"l0-20261124040231-aced649d-f64fac582ecf","author":"zhaoyangxue","createdAt":"2026-11-23T16:17:33.849Z","replyTo":null,"likes":11,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261124040231-aced649d-f64fac582ecf/media/zip.webp","alt":"粉色文具袋的拉链上挂了一颗蓝绿色玻璃珠"}],"text":"另一只耳坠找了一个月。算了，剩的这只去文具袋上班吧。"},{"id":"l0-20261123160434-6fe2232e-5ece2be1c176","author":"guest-e06bc4d76ac27fef","createdAt":"2026-11-23T15:23:07.310Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"小青_1431"},"text":"Blender 里尾巴挂了阻尼跟踪，烘焙完循环看着挺顺。导成 glTF 一播，每回到最后一帧尾巴都猛抽一下。就那一帧，越看越烦。有人碰过吗？"},{"id":"l0-20261123160434-6fe2232e-tail","author":"guest-3e8a18847d2ee535","createdAt":"2026-11-23T15:24:59.310Z","replyTo":"l0-20261123160434-6fe2232e-5ece2be1c176","likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"K2_4730"},"text":"导出的时候，“仅变形骨骼”那项勾了吗？"},{"id":"l0-20261123160434-6fe2232e-eac4cd7cbd06","author":"guest-1c1f47f533e2160a","createdAt":"2026-11-23T14:54:17.168Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"YY_9761"},"text":"看得我火大。他因为老婆不想跟他亲热，跑去跟孩子赌气，这都什么人。她也别拿孩子当挡箭牌啊，你不愿意就是不愿意，凭什么两个人都让小的背这个锅。"},{"id":"l0-20261123160434-6fe2232e-shield-agree","author":"guest-f5f10c962d1de752","createdAt":"2026-11-23T14:55:20.168Z","replyTo":"l0-20261123160434-6fe2232e-eac4cd7cbd06","likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"6804YY"},"text":"这就说到根儿上了。"},{"id":"l0-20261123160434-6fe2232e-shield","author":"visitor-alpha-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-23T15:19:30.168Z","replyTo":"l0-20261123160434-6fe2232e-eac4cd7cbd06","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"这话直得我都替他俩尴尬。"},{"id":"l0-20261123160434-6fe2232e-7623db997ba2","author":"guest-183d15f38b0e11b7","createdAt":"2026-11-23T12:46:22.343Z","replyTo":null,"likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"慢半步_7561"},"text":"那个岗已经挂了八个月，我怀疑面试的人都比他们公司员工多了。"},{"id":"l0-20261123160434-6fe2232e-recruit","author":"guest-c39adbf9663cd130","createdAt":"2026-11-23T13:11:01.343Z","replyTo":"l0-20261123160434-6fe2232e-7623db997ba2","likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261123160434-6fe2232e-7623db997ba2/media/chairs.webp","kind":"image","alt":"办公楼走廊里靠墙排着蓝色空椅子，近处露出文件袋一角"}],"guest":{"name":"545小年"},"text":"这排椅子我从头坐到尾就我一个人。前台叫我早点到，说后面排得满，我请了半天假跑过去。等到我文件袋都捏卷了，才有人出来告诉我，招不招还要再问领导。那之前催我干吗。"},{"id":"l0-20261123160434-6fe2232e-738c3505cad5","author":"guest-a2b5bb663699af8a","createdAt":"2026-11-23T12:44:57.532Z","